   hot corner, opto-triac at 85 degC (the opto-triac's TOPR limit), triac at 125 degC: IDRM1 scaled x75 = 37.5 uA [inference from a typical curve]; against the triac's hot minimum trigger current 2.5 mA x 0.45 = 1.13 mA: x30; across 404 ohm 15.1 mV against VGD 0.2 V (rated at 125 degC): x13.2
